                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "<div class=\"summary-container\">\n  <!-- Left: Text Content -->\n  <div class=\"summary-text\">\n    <p>\n      I am honored to have been selected for the Startmate Student Fellowship Program, a prestigious startup bootcamp. Over two weeks, I delved deep into the startup ecosystem, collaborating with a diverse group of driven students from across Australia and New Zealand. Together, we generated and validated business ideas, engaged directly with potential customers, and developed prototype products. The program provided invaluable mentorship from industry leaders and culminated in pitching our startup concepts to top investors. This experience has equipped me with a comprehensive understanding of startup dynamics and has fueled my passion for entrepreneurship.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Right: Images & Video -->\n  <div class=\"summary-media\">\n    <img src=\"images/business/StartMate/Culture_Amp.jpg\" alt=\"Culture Amp\">\n    <img src=\"images/business/StartMate/Culture_Amp_Speakers.jpg\" alt=\"Culture Amp Speakers\">\n    <img src=\"images/business/StartMate/StartMate_Notion.png\" alt=\"StartMate Fellowship Notion Page\">\n  </div>\n</div>"
                  }
                ]
              },
