                  {
                    "text": "<div class=\"summary-container\">\n  <!-- Left: Text Content -->\n  <div class=\"summary-text\">\n    <p>\n      As Co-founder and CTO of SunAware, I led the development of an innovative solution to track and raise awareness about sun exposure, addressing the critical issue of skin cancer risk. Our startup was selected for an intensive Berkeley Extension accelerator program, where we transformed our idea into a validated business model.<br><br>\n      Through rapid prototyping, customer validation, and strategic mentorship, we developed a prototype and refined our market entry strategy. The experience culminated in a high-stakes pitch to Silicon Valley investors, pushing us to navigate the complexities of startup growth within an accelerated two-week timeline.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Right: Images & Video -->\n  <div class=\"summary-media\">\n    <img src=\"images/business/SunAware/Pitch_Day.jpg\" alt=\"SunAware Pitch Day\">\n    <img src=\"images/business/SunAware/SunAware_Band.png\" alt=\"SunAware Band\">\n  </div>\n</div>"
