                "iconColor": "#E67E22",
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "<div class=\"summary-container\">\n  <!-- Left: Text Content -->\n  <div class=\"summary-text\">\n    <p>\n      Selected as one of the top participants from over 550 applicants, I had the privilege of joining the highly competitive 2023 UBS Investment Banking (IB) Development Challenge. This program provided an immersive experience into the world of investment banking, led by UBS—one of the world’s top financial institutions.<br><br>\n      Throughout the challenge, I:  <ul>\n        <li>Engaged in intensive workshops, networking panels, and hands-on case studies to develop key industry skills.</li>\n        <li>Worked in a high-performing team to craft an acquisition strategy for a private equity client, conducting financial modeling (DCF & LBO) and market research.</li>\n        <li>Developed and presented a professional pitch deck to senior UBS bankers in Sydney, defending our recommendations in a rigorous Q&A session.</li>\n      </ul><br>\n      This experience refined my analytical and strategic thinking skills while offering firsthand exposure to the fast-paced world of investment banking.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Right: Images & Video -->\n  <div class=\"summary-media\">\n    <img src=\"images/business/UBS/UBS_Office.jpg\" alt=\"UBS Office\">\n    <img src=\"images/business/UBS/UBS_Team_Photo.jpg\" alt=\"UBS Team Photo\">\n  </div>\n</div>"
                  }
