                  {
                    "text": "<div class=\"summary-container\">\n  <!-- Left: Text Content -->\n  <div class=\"summary-text\">\n    <p>\n      The Industry & Alumni Mentoring Program is Monash Business School's flagship leadership initiative, connecting students with experienced professionals for career guidance and industry insights.<br><br>\n      In 2022, I was selected for this highly regarded program and paired with a mentor who had over 30 years of experience running private and ASX-listed businesses. Through <strong>weekly mentoring sessions over three months</strong>, I gained invaluable insights into business strategy, leadership, and professional growth.<br><br>\n      My experience included: <ul>\n        <li>Engaging in <strong>one-on-one mentoring</strong> to refine my career trajectory and business acumen.</li>\n        <li>Participating in <strong>personal development workshops</strong> to strengthen my leadership, networking, and communication skills.</li>\n        <li>Expanding my industry network by connecting with alumni and professionals across various sectors.</li>\n      </ul><br>\n      This program provided a strong foundation for professional success, equipping me with the tools to navigate complex business environments and career progression.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Right: Images & Video -->\n  <div class=\"summary-media\">\n    <img src=\"images/business/Mentor_Program/Participation_Certificate.png\" alt=\"Participation Certificate\">\n  </div>\n</div>"
